Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.39,0:00:22.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}出自第六季第四集\N摩根发狂时常念叨的话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.39,0:00:22.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道是什么\N{\rEng}You know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.73,0:00:32.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你本该知道的\N{\rEng}You were supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.62,0:00:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.83,0:00:37.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你本该知道的\N{\rEng}You were supposed to!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.21,0:00:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.05,0:01:24.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始了\N{\rEng}It's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.94,0:01:37.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这把枪能给我吗  等他们来时我好反击\N{\rEng}Can I have that for when they come?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:43.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是你该做的事\N{\rEng}This is not your lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.17,0:01:45.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你留在屋里  小亨利\N{\rEng}You will stay inside, young Henry,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.75,0:01:47.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟其他人待在一起  直到事情结束\N{\rEng}with the others till it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.20,0:01:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我需要帮忙  我需要抵抗\N{\rEng}But I need to help. I need to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.08,0:01:50.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不需要\N{\rEng}No. You do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.89,0:01:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要待在屋里  保护这地方\N{\rEng}You need to stay inside and guard this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.55,0:01:55.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会活下去  并且帮别人活下去\N{\rEng}You will live and help others do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.70,0:01:56.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡萝尔\N{\rEng}Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.57,0:01:59.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我能帮忙的\N{\rEng}You know I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.80,0:02:02.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亨利  如果他们进攻时你在外面  你会死的\N{\rEng}Henry, if you go out there during the attack, you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.13,0:02:11.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保护好他们\N{\rEng}Protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.28,0:02:27.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别放那里  放在角落\N{\rEng}Not there. Those go in the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.71,0:02:30.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说你的特长是什么来着\N{\rEng}What'd you say your specialty was?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.42,0:02:32.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}美国医生头衔  指工作了两年的实习医生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.42,0:02:32.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是第二年急诊住院医师\N{\rEng}I was a second year EM resident at --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.52,0:02:34.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你从未做过手术\N{\rEng}So you have never performed surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.74,0:02:35.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做过三次\N{\rEng}Three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.75,0:02:36.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,截肢手术呢\N{\rEng}Amputations?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.98,0:02:38.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没做过  但我会搞懂的\N{\rEng}No, but I can figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.37,0:02:39.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这力气能按住一个\N{\rEng}Are you even strong enough to hold someone down
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:41.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没被麻醉的人吗\N{\rEng}who hasn't been anesthetized?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.21,0:02:44.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会搞懂的\N{\rEng}I can figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.00,0:02:45.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能开枪吗\N{\rEng}Can you shoot a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.95,0:02:49.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更重要的是  你按住人的同时能开枪吗\N{\rEng}More importantly, can you shoot a gun while you're holding someone down?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.26,0:02:50.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很肯定我知道得够多...\N{\rEng}I'm pretty sure I know enough to --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.62,0:02:51.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\rEng}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.26,0:02:54.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为在我听来  你任何事都懂得不够多\N{\rEng}'Cause it sounds to me like you don't know enough of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.00,0:02:57.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据我的经验  一知半解的人\N{\rEng}And in my experience, people who don't know enough
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:02:59.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比完全不懂的人更危险\N{\rEng}are more dangerous than people who don't know shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.89,0:03:02.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道有很多事我都没做过\N{\rEng}There's a lot I haven't done, I know that,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.51,0:03:04.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但从我第一天去医院上班\N{\rEng}but from my first day at the hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.17,0:03:06.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到这一刻为止\N{\rEng}to this moment right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.41,0:03:09.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做过的都是我没做过的事\N{\rEng}all I've done are things I've never done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.67,0:03:14.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在有人要来袭击这里\N{\rEng}There are people coming, right now, to hurt this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.11,0:03:16.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我站在这里  做好了帮忙的准备\N{\rEng}and I'm standing here ready to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:20.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以别问我做过什么\N{\rEng}So stop asking me what I've done
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.12,0:03:23.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是告诉我该做什么\N{\rEng}and start telling me what to do
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.41,0:03:26.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了把该死的毯子放在哪里\N{\rEng}besides where to put the damn blankets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.86,0:03:30.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢你\N{\rEng}I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.55,0:03:34.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做好准备\N{\rEng}Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.68,0:04:12.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始吧\N{\rEng}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.08,0:04:51.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.10,0:05:21.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还希望好好湿吻一番那扇门呢\N{\rEng}Here I was hoping to give that gate a big ol' wet, sloppy kiss,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.48,0:05:24.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果她却在玩欲擒故纵\N{\rEng}and there she goes, playing hard to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.09,0:05:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿拉特  加里\N{\rEng}Arat, Gary,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.86,0:05:28.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这些讨厌的东西从路上移开\N{\rEng}remove these offending articles from the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.91,0:05:30.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太阳落山了\N{\rEng}The sun is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.70,0:05:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我厌倦了等待\N{\rEng}I'm tired of waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:35.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根  我想跟尼根对话\N{\rEng}Negan. I want to talk to Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.42,0:05:40.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\rEng}Well, hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.26,0:05:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你正在跟尼根对话\N{\rEng}You are speaking to Negan,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.99,0:05:44.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我的出生证明上写着"西蒙"\N{\rEng}but my birth certificate says "Simon."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.57,0:05:47.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我进行这番不愉快对话的人是谁\N{\rEng}With whom do I have the distinct displeasure of speaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.94,0:05:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\rEng}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.06,0:05:52.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬·李\N{\rEng}Maggie Rhee.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.95,0:05:53.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寡妇\N{\rEng}The Widow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.71,0:05:55.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\rEng}Well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.04,0:05:58.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又见面了  李寡妇\N{\rEng}Hello again, Widow Rhee,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.97,0:06:01.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请允许我致以哀悼\N{\rEng}and allow me to offer my condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:04.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,针对过去发生的事和将要发生的事\N{\rEng}For what's happened and what's about to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.59,0:06:07.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为防我说得不够明白\N{\rEng}In case it's not already plain as Hilltop potatoes,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.98,0:06:12.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在下谨代表尼根发言\N{\rEng}yours truly is speaking on behalf of Negan this go 'round.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.88,0:06:14.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我向你保证老大本人\N{\rEng}And I assure you that the man himself
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.86,0:06:18.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲自签收了你隔夜送达的包裹\N{\rEng}personally received your care package next day delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.27,0:06:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我注意到那个棺材\N{\rEng}I noticed it was the box
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.66,0:06:21.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是我出于好意给你的那个\N{\rEng}that I gave you in good faith --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.01,0:06:23.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被骗了\N{\rEng}trick's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.12,0:06:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是时候还债了\N{\rEng}But the bill's come due,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.64,0:06:28.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和你的人将付出代价\N{\rEng}and you and your people are gonna have to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.43,0:06:31.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕是很严重的代价\N{\rEng}Quite dearly, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.87,0:06:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,38个你的人还活着\N{\rEng}Your 38 people are alive and breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.59,0:06:39.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转身离开  别惹我们\N{\rEng}Turn around and leave us be,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.91,0:06:41.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就留他们一命\N{\rEng}and they stay that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.15,0:06:45.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你们不走  我会把38颗子弹\N{\rEng}But if you don't, I have 38 bullets
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.52,0:06:48.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲自打到那38个人身上\N{\rEng}that I will personally fire into all 38.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.35,0:06:55.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美好的夜晚不该浪费在慢慢死亡上\N{\rEng}It's too nice a night to spend it dyin' slow,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.62,0:06:56.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不觉得吗  西蒙\N{\rEng}don't you think, Simon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.12,0:07:02.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说\N{\rEng}How's this gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.16,0:07:06.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬·李\N{\rEng}Well, Maggie Rhee,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.26,0:07:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真是太令人遗憾了  但在我看来\N{\rEng}this is highly regrettable, but the way I see it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你抓住的那些救世军\N{\rEng}the Saviors you're in possession of there
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.70,0:07:14.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是残损品\N{\rEng}are damaged goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.58,0:07:18.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们自己陷入了困境\N{\rEng}You know, they've got themselves into their own pickle,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.81,0:07:21.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而本组织只奖励那些\N{\rEng}and this organization prizes those who,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.74,0:07:23.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A  没被抓住的人\N{\rEng}"A," avoid capture
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.59,0:07:29.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及  B  出事之后自己想办法的人\N{\rEng}and, "B," ‭figure out their own shit when said outcome eventuates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.87,0:07:34.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总而言之  我的意思是  去他们的\N{\rEng}Which, in the end, ‭is my way of saying screw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.83,0:07:38.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真觉得如此荒谬的办法能起作用吗\N{\rEng}Did you really think that cockamamie play would work?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.35,0:07:44.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会起作用的\N{\rEng}It will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.97,0:07:48.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  大伙儿们\N{\rEng}Alright, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.46,0:07:50.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始狂欢吧\N{\rEng}Let's get this party started.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.93,0:07:53.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管我们没带什么枪炮来\N{\rEng}And though we do not come bearing munitions,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.26,0:07:56.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住了  计划有变\N{\rEng}remember -- the plan has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.17,0:07:59.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的目标不再是感染他们  而是杀死他们\N{\rEng}Our goal is not merely infection -- it is conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.72,0:08:02.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要把这些人都干掉\N{\rEng}We are doing away with these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.23,0:08:03.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部干掉\N{\rEng}All of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.19,0:08:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是他想要的\N{\rEng}This isn't what he'd want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.71,0:08:12.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你心里清楚  对吧\N{\rEng}You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:16.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可能还活着\N{\rEng}He could still be out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.67,0:08:22.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定等他回来之后你想面对这个吗\N{\rEng}You sure you wanna face that with him if he shows?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.09,0:08:29.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乞求宽恕总比请求允许要好  小德\N{\rEng}Better to beg forgiveness than ask permission, D.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.39,0:08:30.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后的问题以后再说\N{\rEng}Future problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.59,0:08:43.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上  趁这些混蛋没关门先冲进去\N{\rEng}Go! Through the gate before the assholes close it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.85,0:08:59.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动手\N{\rEng}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:21.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后面的  干掉他们\N{\rEng}Boys in back, light 'em up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.69,0:09:33.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把人质带到我办公室  在结束前看好他们\N{\rEng}Take the prisoners to my office. Hold 'em there 'til it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.92,0:09:36.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧  快  进去  快进去\N{\rEng}Let's go. Go. Inside! Get inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.26,0:09:38.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以帮你保卫这个地方\N{\rEng}I can help you defend this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.69,0:09:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想帮忙\N{\rEng}I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.82,0:09:42.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了  玛姬\N{\rEng}Please, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.61,0:09:44.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我有理由忠于那些人吗\N{\rEng}You think I got a reason to be loyal to these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.24,0:09:47.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬  你进来吗\N{\rEng}Maggie -- you coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.69,0:09:49.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他到底在哪\N{\rEng}Where the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.19,0:09:53.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞭望台  撤退  前线  掩护他们\N{\rEng}Lookouts, fall back! Front line, give 'em cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.81,0:10:37.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不见\N{\rEng}Long time, no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.60,0:10:39.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的  有我呢\N{\rEng}It's okay. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.49,0:10:48.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来解决转角那个小可爱\N{\rEng}I'll take out sunshine around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.42,0:10:53.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-除非你想搞定她  小德  -不想\N{\rEng}- Unless you want her, D. - ‭No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.77,0:10:54.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那下一个你来搞定怎么样\N{\rEng}Well, how 'bout the next one, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.98,0:10:56.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在需要团队合作\N{\rEng}I'm gonna need a group effort here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.92,0:10:58.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走\N{\rEng}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.31,0:11:00.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我守着他\N{\rEng}I'll stay with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.09,0:11:33.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔拉\N{\rEng}Tara!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.21,0:11:57.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达里尔  时候到了\N{\rEng}Daryl, it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.07,0:11:59.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬发信号了  我们得走了\N{\rEng}Maggie gave the signal. We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.29,0:12:04.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达里尔\N{\rEng}Daryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.69,0:12:50.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屁都看不清\N{\rEng}I can't see shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.25,0:13:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人以前就逃跑过\N{\rEng}These people have run before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.81,0:13:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿拉特  带几个人绕后\N{\rEng}Arat, take a team around back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.80,0:13:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包围这个地方\N{\rEng}I want the place surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.15,0:13:18.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加里  你的小队去拖车那边\N{\rEng}Gary, your group goes for the trailers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.69,0:13:22.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-慢点  轻点  明白吗  -明白\N{\rEng}- Slow and quiet, capiche? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.26,0:13:28.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的人呢\N{\rEng}The rest of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.94,0:13:33.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的人搞个上门服务\N{\rEng}The rest of us are making a house call.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.17,0:13:37.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果家里有人的话\N{\rEng}Well, if anybody's home...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.29,0:13:42.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该适当屠宰一下了\N{\rEng}it's time to do ‭some proper slaughtering.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.04,0:14:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的  不要\N{\rEng}God damn it, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.41,0:14:09.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退到卡车那边去  快快快\N{\rEng}Back to the trucks! Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.89,0:14:38.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走  走\N{\rEng}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.80,0:14:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续走\N{\rEng}Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.24,0:14:59.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别起来\N{\rEng}Just stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.21,0:15:08.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道是什么\N{\rEng}You know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.49,0:15:18.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道是什么\N{\rEng}You know what it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.47,0:15:49.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想杀了他们\N{\rEng}I wanted them dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.71,0:15:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀光他们\N{\rEng}All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.11,0:15:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤其是尼根\N{\rEng}Negan most of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.78,0:15:56.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.03,0:15:59.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\rEng}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.17,0:16:03.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到他了吗\N{\rEng}Did you see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.15,0:16:05.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没来\N{\rEng}He wasn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.83,0:16:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在外边看到过他\N{\rEng}I saw him out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.11,0:16:11.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我离队想杀了他\N{\rEng}I broke away and tried to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.50,0:16:18.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没得手  但我努力过\N{\rEng}I didn't, but I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.97,0:16:25.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.96,0:16:50.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没资源击退下一次进攻了\N{\rEng}We don't have the resources to fight off another attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.43,0:16:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备撤离吧\N{\rEng}Be ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.92,0:16:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不该出来的\N{\rEng}Hey. ‭You shouldn't be out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.39,0:16:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是擦伤而已\N{\rEng}Oh, it's just...it's just a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.96,0:17:00.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能帮忙\N{\rEng}I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.09,0:17:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一伤更重怎么办\N{\rEng}What if it wasn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.37,0:17:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是我自己的错了\N{\rEng}Then it'd be my own damn fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.30,0:17:05.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我  他才回救世军的\N{\rEng}He's back with them because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.74,0:17:08.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  他回救世军是因为他就是那种人\N{\rEng}No, he's back with 'em 'cause that's who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.83,0:17:10.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很幸运\N{\rEng}We...We got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.89,0:17:13.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碰到了玛姬  瑞克\N{\rEng}Finding Maggie...Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.19,0:17:14.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本可能不一样的\N{\rEng}It could've been different.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.93,0:17:18.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前我跟着总督时就不一样\N{\rEng}It was, for me, ‭when I was with the Governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.30,0:17:19.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  但现在你不跟总督了\N{\rEng}Yeah, but you weren't one of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.21,0:17:22.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我以前跟过\N{\rEng}But I was with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:25.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你哥哥也跟过\N{\rEng}Your brother, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.38,0:17:26.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哥\N{\rEng}My brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.73,0:17:29.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哥一生都没走对路\N{\rEng}My brother ran the wrong way his whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.21,0:17:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他还在  如果他走的时候我跟着他\N{\rEng}If he were here, if I stuck with him when he left,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:33.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也会加入救世军\N{\rEng}we'd be with the Saviors, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.11,0:17:35.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或加入其他一样坏的团体\N{\rEng}or some other group just like 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.91,0:17:38.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我会看清他们的真面目  就像你一样\N{\rEng}But I'd have figured out who they were just like you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许德怀特也是这样\N{\rEng}Maybe that's what happened to Dwight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.28,0:17:43.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是在他杀死你女朋友之前还是之后\N{\rEng}Is that before or after he killed your girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.08,0:17:46.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是说你们已经两清了\N{\rEng}Or is that all square now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.67,0:17:50.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两清了\N{\rEng}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.27,0:17:55.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可能会永远恨他  但他救了我的命\N{\rEng}Look, I might hate him forever, but he saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.46,0:17:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  他昨晚想杀了你\N{\rEng}No, he tried to kill you last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.74,0:18:00.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在树林时  在来这的路上\N{\rEng}When we were in the woods, when we were coming here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.70,0:18:02.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到他尽力帮我们赢\N{\rEng}I saw him try and help us win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.73,0:18:04.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我也看到了我看到的\N{\rEng}Yeah. I saw what I saw, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.79,0:18:29.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你留了块萝卜\N{\rEng}Saved you this turnip.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.21,0:18:32.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不吃\N{\rEng}Yeah. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.43,0:18:48.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\rEng}Rick...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.16,0:18:51.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬为了省油把发电机关了\N{\rEng}Maggie turned off the generators to save on gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.05,0:18:53.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么热的天  孩子们需要新鲜空气\N{\rEng}The kids are gonna need air in this heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.59,0:19:10.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让我看看你的伤口吗\N{\rEng}Can I take a look at that cut?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.46,0:19:13.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有清洗的用品\N{\rEng}I have some stuff to clean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.21,0:19:16.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我先把这个干完\N{\rEng}Let me get this done first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.50,0:19:45.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到他在车队后面\N{\rEng}I saw him at the back of the convoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.46,0:19:46.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才那么做\N{\rEng}That's why I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.59,0:19:53.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须试一下\N{\rEng}I had to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.73,0:19:55.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须\N{\rEng}I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.76,0:20:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以让你出去  派个守卫跟着你\N{\rEng}We can get you outside the gates...with a guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.30,0:20:39.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你埋葬你的人\N{\rEng}So you can bury your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.54,0:20:43.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不是我的人\N{\rEng}They're not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.58,0:20:46.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我很欣慰你这样看待他们\N{\rEng}But I'm glad you see them that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.52,0:20:48.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当人看\N{\rEng}As people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.21,0:21:06.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\rEng}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.86,0:21:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是...  你是个好领袖\N{\rEng}Just...you're a good leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.63,0:21:17.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我之前就知道  但昨晚\N{\rEng}I knew it before, but last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.39,0:21:21.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你保住了大门\N{\rEng}You saved the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.48,0:21:23.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你救了整个社区\N{\rEng}You saved the community.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.65,0:21:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你救了很多人命\N{\rEng}You saved lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.72,0:21:30.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他们牺牲了自己的命\N{\rEng}Because they sacrificed theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.64,0:21:36.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我救囚犯  仅是因为尼根还在\N{\rEng}I only saved the prisoners 'cause Negan is still in play.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.81,0:21:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他们还有利用价值\N{\rEng}Which means they could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:42.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我用棺材给尼根寄去那具尸体是为了激怒他\N{\rEng}I sent Negan that body in the box to make him mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.66,0:21:46.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引他来这\N{\rEng}To lure him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.76,0:21:53.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我希望我丈夫的坟\N{\rEng}'Cause I wanted my husband's...grave
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.42,0:21:54.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他最后看见的东西\N{\rEng}to be the last thing he saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.03,0:21:59.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使要付出代价\N{\rEng}Even if it came at a cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.15,0:22:06.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道这样的我是不是好领袖\N{\rEng}I don't know if that makes me a good leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.28,0:22:12.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只知道我唯一的遗憾是\N{\rEng}I do know ‭that the only regret I have
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.48,0:22:15.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根不在那堆尸体中\N{\rEng}is that Negan is not in that pile of bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.00,0:22:21.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你让我很担心\N{\rEng}You had me worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.43,0:22:23.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个嘛\N{\rEng}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.62,0:22:27.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我知道被刺一刀能得到你的关注\N{\rEng}if I'd known getting stabbed would get your attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.23,0:22:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早就这么做了\N{\rEng}I would've done it a lot sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.41,0:22:36.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉我那样离开\N{\rEng}I'm sorry for how I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.25,0:22:38.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对你所做的事\N{\rEng}What I did to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.95,0:22:42.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要你的道歉\N{\rEng}I don't need an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.26,0:22:45.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不欠我什么\N{\rEng}You don't owe me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.73,0:22:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过  我的确一直在思考原因\N{\rEng}But, uh, I guess I have been wondering why.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.65,0:22:58.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对我动过真感情吗\N{\rEng}Was any of it real?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.42,0:23:01.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时不想要真感情\N{\rEng}I didn't want it to be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.59,0:23:04.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是在演戏\N{\rEng}I was pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.63,0:23:09.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用顾及我的感受\N{\rEng}Well, don't go easy on me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.97,0:23:12.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时想好好生活\N{\rEng}I was trying to live a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.44,0:23:17.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后发现我们还没消灭救世军\N{\rEng}Then we found out that we hadn't gotten rid of the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.57,0:23:19.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会有更多的斗争和死亡\N{\rEng}And that there would be more fighting and more dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.63,0:23:20.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我受不了\N{\rEng}And I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.65,0:23:26.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时正好...\N{\rEng}And it was right about the time that...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.63,0:23:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉...\N{\rEng}it felt like --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.24,0:23:34.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉好像是...\N{\rEng}like -- like maybe it wasn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.99,0:23:39.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像不用再装下去了\N{\rEng}like maybe it wasn't going to be pretending anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.83,0:23:43.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许\N{\rEng}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.12,0:23:45.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\rEng}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.13,0:23:48.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可能是其他人给我说过的\N{\rEng}that just might be one of the nicest things
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.30,0:23:50.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好的话之一了\N{\rEng}anybody's ever said to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.57,0:23:58.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\rEng}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.05,0:24:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还会离开吗\N{\rEng}You gonna leave again?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.79,0:24:05.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在一切结束之后\N{\rEng}After it's over?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.01,0:24:09.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\rEng}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.89,0:24:14.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我可能只是接受了\N{\rEng}I think I might just accept that
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.63,0:24:18.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些人足够幸运可以活下来\N{\rEng}some of us are lucky enough to just live,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.17,0:24:20.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些人足够幸运可以去战斗\N{\rEng}some of us are ‭lucky enough to just fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.04,0:24:23.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束之后也是吗\N{\rEng}Even after it ends?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.54,0:24:25.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不认为会结束\N{\rEng}I don't think it ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.60,0:24:28.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在做的事\N{\rEng}What we're doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.27,0:24:34.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这场战争的结束  是我们战斗的目标\N{\rEng}The end of the fight is -- is what we're fighting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.59,0:24:39.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,获胜只代表我们赢了明天\N{\rEng}Winning just means we get tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.97,0:24:47.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许再加一晚\N{\rEng}Maybe one more night.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.58,0:25:00.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许再加一个早晨\N{\rEng}Maybe one more morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.27,0:25:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那之后\N{\rEng}After that...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.24,0:25:07.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无法保证\N{\rEng}no guarantees.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.57,0:25:36.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我出去参战也不会死的\N{\rEng}I wouldn't have died if I went out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.92,0:25:38.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会的  亨利\N{\rEng}You would have, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.12,0:25:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我  你会的\N{\rEng}Just trust me -- you would have.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.94,0:25:52.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以帮你处理伤口\N{\rEng}I could treat your wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.75,0:25:56.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要感染了\N{\rEng}Wouldn't want it to get infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.93,0:26:13.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一种为亡者祈祷的仪式\N{\rEng}There's, um... a prayer for the dead
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.54,0:26:16.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我第一次听到的时候还是个小孩\N{\rEng}I first heard when I was a little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.47,0:26:22.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一句是\N{\rEng}It, uh... ended with the phrase,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.77,0:26:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要让我们跟随他们误入歧途\N{\rEng}"Do not send us astray after 'them'" --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.71,0:26:31.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-那些死去的人  -别说了\N{\rEng}- those who died... - ‭Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.13,0:27:04.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样\N{\rEng}How you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.47,0:27:08.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还好\N{\rEng}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.22,0:27:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西迪克和丹娜医生很棒\N{\rEng}Siddiq and Dr. Dana, they're -- they're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.16,0:27:14.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缝合的时候都没感觉到\N{\rEng}Didn't even feel 'em stitching me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.86,0:27:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有他们在  我们很幸运\N{\rEng}We're lucky to have 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.20,0:27:18.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有你在  我们很幸运\N{\rEng}We're lucky to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.08,0:27:20.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是格雷戈里掌事\N{\rEng}If Gregory was in charge,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.22,0:27:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个地方会不复存在\N{\rEng}this -- this place wouldn't be here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.73,0:27:24.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只顾自己\N{\rEng}He was about himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.91,0:27:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只管自己想要什么\N{\rEng}What he wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.93,0:27:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是这样的\N{\rEng}That's not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.70,0:28:57.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\rEng}Hey. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.04,0:29:03.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是...  他们...\N{\rEng}Mnh...it wasn't...they...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.67,0:29:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你发烧了\N{\rEng}Ah, you're burning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.78,0:29:07.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去叫医生\N{\rEng}I'm gonna go get the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.70,0:29:12.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\rEng}Just hold tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.24,0:31:16.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是格雷戈里吗\N{\rEng}You're Gregory, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.61,0:31:17.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\rEng}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.24,0:31:19.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.69,0:31:22.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我出去\N{\rEng}Let me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.06,0:31:24.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道是谁杀了我哥哥吗\N{\rEng}Do you know which one killed my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.16,0:31:27.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你哥哥是谁\N{\rEng}I-I don't know who your brother is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.75,0:31:29.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人我一个都不认识\N{\rEng}I-I don't know any of these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.86,0:31:33.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和他们不是一伙的\N{\rEng}I'm not one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.08,0:31:44.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拿的武器非常危险  孩子\N{\rEng}That's a very dangerous weapon you got there, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.82,0:31:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不希望你受伤\N{\rEng}Uh, I don't want you to get hurt --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.65,0:31:51.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不希望任何人受伤\N{\rEng}I don't want anyone to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.52,0:31:59.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你何不交给我  然后我们谈谈\N{\rEng}Why don't you give it to me, and we can talk, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.94,0:32:06.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你哥哥的事我很遗憾\N{\rEng}I'm sorry about your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.48,0:32:10.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀死他们不会让他起死回生\N{\rEng}Killing them ‭isn't gonna bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.03,0:32:12.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.47,0:32:13.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那会令我好受些\N{\rEng}But it'll make me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.81,0:32:16.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经好受过一次了\N{\rEng}It already did once.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.16,0:32:20.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你和他们不是一伙  为什么会被关进去\N{\rEng}And why would you be in here if you're not with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.87,0:32:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又不傻\N{\rEng}I'm not dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.87,0:32:24.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们某人知道谁杀了本\N{\rEng}One of you knows who killed Ben,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.61,0:32:26.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有必要的话  我会一个个枪杀你们\N{\rEng}and if I have to, ‭I'm gonna start shooting people
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.76,0:32:28.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到某人告诉我\N{\rEng}until someone tells me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.35,0:32:30.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子  我懂\N{\rEng}Hey, kid. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.99,0:32:32.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哥哥也死了\N{\rEng}My -- My big brother died, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.03,0:32:36.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀一些或许与你哥哥的死有关的人\N{\rEng}Killing a buncha guys who mighta had something to do with it
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.93,0:32:40.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然听起来很爽\N{\rEng}sounds pretty damn good in theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.41,0:32:44.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  那不会让你好受\N{\rEng}But, uh, it's not gonna make you feel any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.38,0:32:47.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会维持很久\N{\rEng}Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.82,0:32:50.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道的\N{\rEng}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.66,0:32:53.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-怎么了  艾尔  -没什么  继续睡\N{\rEng}- What's up, Al? - Nothing. Go back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.58,0:33:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以西结  掩护我们背后\N{\rEng}Ezekiel, please watch our back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.20,0:33:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞克  我需要你...\N{\rEng}Rick, ‭I'm gonna need you to...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.07,0:33:41.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.42,0:33:55.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来\N{\rEng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.29,0:34:03.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如音乐般动听\N{\rEng}Music to my ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.97,0:34:07.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你吗\N{\rEng}Was it you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.44,0:34:14.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么  孩子\N{\rEng}I don't know what the hell you're talking about, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.07,0:34:30.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想知道谁杀了我哥哥\N{\rEng}I want the guy who killed my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.75,0:34:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁最好现在就告诉我\N{\rEng}Somebody better tell me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.91,0:34:35.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你很愤怒  好吗  我当时也是\N{\rEng}Look, I know you're angry. Okay? I know. I was, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.30,0:34:39.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是真做出来比嘴上说说更难挽回\N{\rEng}But words are a lot easier t-to live with than actions, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.30,0:34:43.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男人一点  站出来\N{\rEng}Be a man and step forward
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.16,0:34:45.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样我就不用杀你的朋友们了\N{\rEng}so I don't have to kill your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.84,0:34:49.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会数到十  然后开始射击\N{\rEng}I'm gonna count to 10 and start shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.21,0:34:55.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一  二  三\N{\rEng}1...2...3...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.85,0:34:58.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四  五\N{\rEng}...4...5...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.52,0:35:15.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门开了  弟兄们  快跑\N{\rEng}Gate's open, boys! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.96,0:35:49.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么\N{\rEng}The hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.80,0:35:50.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\rEng}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.89,0:35:52.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许行尸进来了\N{\rEng}Maybe walkers got in.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.19,0:35:53.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是战斗时混进来的\N{\rEng}Maybe during the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.67,0:35:55.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他们都是我们自己人\N{\rEng}These are our own people, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.55,0:36:11.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后\N{\rEng}Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.79,0:36:36.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吗\N{\rEng}You alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.35,0:36:38.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事  只是...\N{\rEng}Yeah, just...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.18,0:36:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没被咬\N{\rEng}He wasn't bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.11,0:36:43.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他转变了\N{\rEng}But he turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.55,0:36:49.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根的球棒\N{\rEng}Negan's bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.78,0:36:55.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和他在外面时  球棒沾满了尸血\N{\rEng}When I was out there with him, it was covered in walker blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.94,0:36:57.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为他只是碰到了一些行尸\N{\rEng}I just thought he'd crossed some.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.73,0:37:00.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是或许\N{\rEng}But maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.03,0:37:03.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们又奴役我们了\N{\rEng}They have us working for them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.04,0:37:07.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们自相残杀\N{\rEng}Killin' our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.68,0:37:10.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是发烧\N{\rEng}It's the fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.74,0:37:13.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个\N{\rEng}That's what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.13,0:37:17.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在说得通了\N{\rEng}It makes sense now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.45,0:37:27.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们某人\N{\rEng}One of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.55,0:37:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须动手\N{\rEng}you're gonna have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.53,0:37:34.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\rEng}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.04,0:37:37.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须替我做\N{\rEng}You gotta do it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.06,0:37:40.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\rEng}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.78,0:37:43.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\rEng}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.04,0:38:05.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面还好吗\N{\rEng}Good out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.79,0:38:06.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,房子安全了\N{\rEng}House is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.68,0:38:08.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\rEng}How'd this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.11,0:38:23.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救世军对武器做了一些处理\N{\rEng}Um...the Saviors did something to their weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.73,0:38:27.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何被他们割伤或击中的人\N{\rEng}Everyone they cut up... or got shot...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.80,0:38:30.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都会生病\N{\rEng}they all got sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.29,0:38:32.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中一些人转变了\N{\rEng}Some of 'em turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.63,0:38:34.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.17,0:38:37.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.48,0:38:44.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.85,0:38:48.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在外面时\N{\rEng}When we were out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.07,0:38:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说你等够了\N{\rEng}and you said you were done waiting,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.08,0:38:55.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本能杀了他的\N{\rEng}I coulda killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.01,0:38:57.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该杀了他的\N{\rEng}I shoulda.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.64,0:39:00.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  他想和我们在一起\N{\rEng}No. He wanted to be here with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.02,0:39:04.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管他怎么做  不管他怎么努力\N{\rEng}And no matter what he did or how hard he tried,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.99,0:39:06.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都希望他死\N{\rEng}I wanted him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.55,0:39:11.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我无法接受其他结果\N{\rEng}I just couldn't ‭let it be anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.31,0:39:18.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命运弄人  对吧\N{\rEng}Karma's a bitch, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.36,0:39:36.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,举起手来\N{\rEng}Hands up, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.86,0:39:38.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是在帮忙\N{\rEng}Hey, we're trying to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.37,0:39:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个孩子来打开了围栏  里面有人转变了\N{\rEng}A-A-A kid came and opened up the pen. We had people turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.23,0:39:42.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一部分人逃了\N{\rEng}A bunch of 'em left, but a
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.34,0:39:43.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但也有一部分人在试图关上门\N{\rEng}bunch of 'em are trying to close that gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.03,0:39:45.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬  看\N{\rEng}Maggie, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.53,0:39:49.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴安\N{\rEng}Dianne.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.89,0:39:51.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得令  走\N{\rEng}We're on it. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.60,0:39:58.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里做什么\N{\rEng}What are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.89,0:40:01.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想来看看囚犯  但围栏空了\N{\rEng}I went to check on the prisoners, but the pen was empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.76,0:40:06.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人呢\N{\rEng}Where are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.24,0:40:08.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们没说去哪\N{\rEng}They didn't say where they were goin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.38,0:40:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们只是跑了\N{\rEng}They just ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.18,0:40:11.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没跑吗\N{\rEng}And you didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.65,0:40:13.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到了我们对尼根和西蒙来说一文不值\N{\rEng}You saw what we mean to Negan and Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.11,0:40:16.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说这话可能很蠢\N{\rEng}Which might be a dumb thing to say --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.64,0:40:18.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们对你们来说也不值什么\N{\rEng}it doesn't make us worth much to your people, either,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.44,0:40:21.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是留下的人都是真心的\N{\rEng}but...those of us that stayed, stayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.23,0:40:24.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有很多机会逃跑\N{\rEng}We had plenty of chances to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.78,0:40:40.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\rEng}Henry!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.55,0:40:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亨利  如果你在下面  快出来\N{\rEng}Henry, if you're down here, come on out!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.84,0:40:49.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们所有地方都找过了\N{\rEng}Yo. ‭We've checked everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.42,0:40:50.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子不见了\N{\rEng}The little man's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.05,0:40:54.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有几个救世军说在其他人逃跑前\N{\rEng}Hey. Some of the Saviors said Henry broke into the pen,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.16,0:40:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亨利闯进了围栏里\N{\rEng}just before the others escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.69,0:40:58.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他之前在那里  现在不在了\N{\rEng}He was down there, and then he wasn't.
